nge the quality and service of Creole Country. I felt like a Tourist when I asked when they were going to start selling Boudin. To my surprise they have be..."},{"business_id":"r6DogeV6TtvZXZ2sMemibg","review_id":"ZfUhYyxKbRMwfQvygX2wvw","date":"2020-02-29T20:13:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9249228835105896,"text_excerpt":"The smoked chaurice sausage is incredible. It is quite spicy and Creole Country is the only vendor I know that makes it in the New Orleans area. The crawfish and green onion sausage is also very good."},{"business_id":"r6DogeV6TtvZXZ2sMemibg","review_id":"JRUR9qyShg79OONnkElXEw","date":"2011-08-18T21:47:30","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9156090617179871,"text_excerpt":"I have bought Creole Country andouille for over 6 years and can say it is the best andouille made in the state, the other sausages Vaughn produces are also incredible, I have never made it to the store, even though I have had many invites (job demands) but I can say if you want the best go to Creole Country. By the way their Alligator sausage makes a killer gumbo!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"r6DogeV6TtvZXZ2sMemibg","photo_id":"sVglyLkzblI7yi6oJaqiLA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/sVglyLkzblI7yi6oJaqiLA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9097015261650085},{"business_id":"r6DogeV6TtvZXZ2sMemibg","photo_id":"u4zOHnaXxAZJmCPKBau0bw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/u4zOHnaXxAZJmCPKBau0bw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9097014665603638}]},"notebook_case":null}
